# Agents — track only project-specific *-agent-skill/ directories under
# .agents/skills/. User-local plugin caches (Matt Pocock skills, etc.) are
# ignored individually. Pattern: ignore everything under .agents/ EXCEPT
# the .agents/skills/*-agent-skill/ subdirs the project commits.
.agents/*
!.agents/skills/
.agents/skills/*
!.agents/skills/*-agent-skill/

# Sandcastle — the .sandcastle/ orchestrator config IS tracked (Dockerfile,
# main.mts, prompts). Its own .sandcastle/.gitignore ignores the ephemeral
# .env, logs/, and worktrees/.

# Expo prebuild generated native projects
apps/mobile/android/
apps/mobile/ios/
.playwright-mcp/rnr-docs-snapshot.md
.playwright-mcp/page-2026-05-16T06-51-22-523Z.yml
.impeccable/
